# CodeRelay MVP requires no committed runtime secrets.
#
# Pairing secrets are generated per pairing on the host and never leave the
# host or the paired device's SecureStore. Tailscale, tunnels, DNS, and routers
# are user-owned and out of scope. OpenCode provider credentials stay in
# OpenCode's own host-side configuration.
#
# This file intentionally contains no variables yet. Add a commented example
# here only when a real, non-secret configuration value is introduced.
